<p dir=3D"auto">HTML5 semantic tags define the function and the category of=
 your text, simplifying the work for browsers and search engines, as well a=
s developers.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto">HTML5 offers new semantic elements to define different part=
s of a web page:</p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li><code>&lt;article&gt;</code></li>
<li><code>&lt;aside&gt;</code></li>
<li><code>&lt;details&gt;</code></li>
<li><code>&lt;figcaption&gt;</code></li>
<li><code>&lt;figure&gt;</code></li>
<li><code>&lt;footer&gt;</code></li>
<li><code>&lt;header&gt;</code></li>
<li><code>&lt;main&gt;</code></li>
<li><code>&lt;mark&gt;</code></li>
<li><code>&lt;nav&gt;</code></li>
<li><code>&lt;section&gt;</code></li>
<li><code>&lt;summary&gt;</code></li>
<li><code>&lt;time&gt;</code></li>
</ul>
