<p dir=3D"auto">The web page is rendered in quirks mode. The web browsers e=
ngines use quirks mode to support older browsers which does not follow the =
<strong>W3C specifications</strong>. In quirks mode CSS class and id names =
are case insensitive. In standards mode they are case sensitive.</p>
