<p dir=3D"auto">In order to render content the browser has to go through a =
series of steps:</p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li>Document Object Model(DOM)</li>
<li>CSS object model(CSSOM)</li>
<li>Render Tree</li>
<li>Layout</li>
<li>Paint</li>
</ul>
