 &lt;footer&gt;</code> and how should each be used in structuring html mark=
up?</h2><a id=3D"user-content-q-what-are-the-semantic-meanings-for-section-=
article-aside-nav-header-footer-and-how-should-each-be-used-in-structuring-=
