tents">=E2=86=A5 back to top</a></b>
</div>
<div class=3D"markdown-heading" dir=3D"auto"><h2 tabindex=3D"-1" class=3D"h=
eading-element" dir=3D"auto">Q. When should you use <code>section</code>, <=
code>div</code> or <code>article</code>?</h2><a id=3D"user-content-q-when-s=
hould-you-use-section-div-or-article" class=3D"anchor" aria-label=3D"Permal=
ink: Q. When should you use section, div or article?" href=3D"https://githu=
b.com/learning-zone/html-basics#q-when-should-you-use-section-div-or-articl=
e"><svg data-component=3D"Octicon" class=3D"octicon octicon-link" viewBox=
=3D"0 0 16 16" version=3D"1.1" width=3D"16" height=3D"16" aria-hidden=3D"tr=
ue"><path d=3D"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 =
3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1=
.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0=
 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83=
