<p dir=3D"auto">The <code>&lt;section&gt;</code> tag creates independent se=
ctions within a webpage having logically connected content. And the <code>&=
lt;div&gt;</code> tag is an empty container specifying a division or a sect=
ion.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>The <code>&lt;section&gt;</code> Element</strong></=
p>
