<p dir=3D"auto">When an event fires, the browser automatically passes an <s=
trong>event object</strong> to the handler. It contains details about the e=
vent and the element it occurred on.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Commonly used properties:</strong></p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Property / Method</th>
<th>Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>event.type</code></td>
<td>The event type (e.g., <code>"click"</code>, <code>"keydown"</code>)</td=
>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>event.target</code></td>
<td>The element that <strong>triggered</strong> the event</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>event.currentTarget</code></td>
<td>The element the listener is <strong>attached to</strong></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>event.bubbles</code></td>
<td><code>true</code> if the event bubbles</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>event.cancelable</code></td>
<td><code>true</code> if <code>preventDefault()</code> can stop the default=
 action</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>event.timeStamp</code></td>
<td>Time (ms) when the event was created</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>event.preventDefault()</code></td>
<td>Cancels the default browser action</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>event.stopPropagation()</code></td>
<td>Stops event from bubbling/capturing further</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Mouse event properties:</strong></p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Property</th>
<th>Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>event.clientX / clientY</code></td>
<td>Cursor position relative to the viewport</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>event.pageX / pageY</code></td>
<td>Cursor position relative to the page</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>event.button</code></td>
<td>Mouse button pressed (0=3Dleft, 1=3Dmiddle, 2=3Dright)</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Keyboard event properties:</strong></p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Property</th>
<th>Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>event.key</code></td>
<td>The key value (e.g., <code>"Enter"</code>, <code>"a"</code>)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>event.code</code></td>
<td>Physical key code (e.g., <code>"KeyA"</code>, <code>"ArrowUp"</code>)</=
td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>event.shiftKey / ctrlKey / altKey</code></td>
<td>Modifier key state</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
