<p dir=3D"auto">An HTML <code>&lt;form&gt;</code> element is used to collec=
t user input and send it to a server for processing. It acts as a container=
 for interactive controls like text fields, checkboxes, radio buttons, drop=
downs, and submit buttons.</p>
