<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Key <code>&lt;form&gt;</code> attributes:</strong><=
/p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Attribute</th>
<th>Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>action</code></td>
<td>URL where form data is sent on submission</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>method</code></td>
<td>HTTP method: <code>GET</code> (data in URL) or <code>POST</code> (data =
in body)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>enctype</code></td>
<td>Encoding type for form data (important for file uploads)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>novalidate</code></td>
<td>Disables browser's built-in validation</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>autocomplete</code></td>
<td>Enables/disables browser autocomplete (<code>on</code>/<code>off</code>=
)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>target</code></td>
<td>Where to display the response (<code>_self</code>, <code>_blank</code>,=
 etc.)</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>GET vs POST:</strong></p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th></th>
<th><code>GET</code></th>
<th><code>POST</code></th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
