<p dir=3D"auto">HTML provides a wide range of <code>&lt;input&gt;</code> ty=
pes to collect different kinds of data:</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Text &amp; Data Entry:</strong></p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Type</th>
<th>Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>text</code></td>
<td>Single-line plain text (default)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>password</code></td>
<td>Masked text input</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>email</code></td>
<td>Email address (with basic format validation)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>number</code></td>
<td>Numeric input with optional min/max/step</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>tel</code></td>
<td>Telephone number</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>url</code></td>
<td>URL with format validation</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>search</code></td>
<td>Search query field</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Date &amp; Time:</strong></p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Type</th>
<th>Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>date</code></td>
<td>Date picker (yyyy-mm-dd)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>time</code></td>
<td>Time picker (hh:mm)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>datetime-local</code></td>
<td>Date and time (no timezone)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>month</code></td>
<td>Month and year picker</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>week</code></td>
<td>Week picker</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Selection &amp; Choice:</strong></p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Type</th>
<th>Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>checkbox</code></td>
<td>Boolean toggle (can select multiple)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>radio</code></td>
<td>Single choice from a group</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>range</code></td>
<td>Slider for a numeric range</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>color</code></td>
<td>Color picker</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>File &amp; Action:</strong></p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Type</th>
<th>Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>file</code></td>
<td>File upload control</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>submit</code></td>
<td>Submits the form</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>reset</code></td>
<td>Resets all fields to default values</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>button</code></td>
<td>Generic button (no default action)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>hidden</code></td>
<td>Hidden field (not shown to user, value sent with form)</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
