<p dir=3D"auto">The <code>&lt;button&gt;</code> element has three <code>typ=
e</code> values that control its behavior inside a form:</p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Type</th>
<th>Behavior</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>type=3D"submit"</code></td>
<td>Submits the form (default when inside a <code>&lt;form&gt;</code>)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>type=3D"reset"</code></td>
<td>Resets all form fields to their initial values</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>type=3D"button"</code></td>
<td>No default action =E2=80=94 used with JavaScript event handlers</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
