<p dir=3D"auto">The <code>autocomplete</code> attribute controls whether th=
e browser should automatically fill in form field values based on the user'=
s previously entered data.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Values:</strong></p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Value</th>
<th>Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>on</code></td>
<td>Browser may autocomplete (default for most inputs)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>off</code></td>
<td>Browser should not autocomplete</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Named tokens</td>
<td>Tells browser what kind of data to fill in</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Example:</strong></p>
