<p dir=3D"auto">An HTML table is created using the <code>&lt;table&gt;</cod=
e> element along with a set of related tags to define rows, headers, and da=
ta cells.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Core table elements:</strong></p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Element</th>
<th>Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>&lt;table&gt;</code></td>
<td>The root container for the table</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>&lt;thead&gt;</code></td>
<td>Groups header rows =E2=80=94 rendered at the top</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>&lt;tbody&gt;</code></td>
<td>Groups the main body rows</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>&lt;tfoot&gt;</code></td>
<td>Groups footer rows =E2=80=94 rendered at the bottom</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>&lt;tr&gt;</code></td>
<td>Defines a table row</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>&lt;th&gt;</code></td>
<td>Defines a header cell (bold + centered by default)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>&lt;td&gt;</code></td>
<td>Defines a standard data cell</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>&lt;caption&gt;</code></td>
<td>Provides a title/description for the table</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>&lt;colgroup&gt;</code></td>
<td>Groups columns for applying styles</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>&lt;col&gt;</code></td>
<td>Specifies properties for one or more columns within <code>&lt;colgroup&=
gt;</code></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
