<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Why use <code>&lt;thead&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;tbody=
&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;tfoot&gt;</code>?</strong></p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li>Browsers can scroll <code>&lt;tbody&gt;</code> independently while keep=
ing headers/footers fixed</li>
<li>Screen readers use them to better announce table structure</li>
<li>When printing, the browser can repeat <code>&lt;thead&gt;</code> and <c=
ode>&lt;tfoot&gt;</code> on every page</li>
</ul>
