<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Why it matters:</strong></p>
<ol dir=3D"auto">
<li><strong>Accessibility</strong> =E2=80=94 Screen readers announce the ca=
ption before reading the table, giving users context about what data follow=
s. This is especially important for complex tables.</li>
<li><strong>Discoverability</strong> =E2=80=94 Users who navigate by tables=
 (using AT shortcuts) see the caption first, helping them decide whether to=
 enter the table.</li>
<li><strong>SEO</strong> =E2=80=94 Provides semantic meaning to search engi=
nes about the table's content.</li>
</ol>
