<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>CSS properties that work on <code>&lt;col&gt;</code=
>:</strong></p>
<p dir=3D"auto">Only a limited subset of CSS applies to <code>&lt;col&gt;</=
code>:</p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li><code>width</code></li>
<li><code>background</code> / <code>background-color</code></li>
<li><code>border</code></li>
<li><code>visibility</code></li>
</ul>
<blockquote>
<p dir=3D"auto">Most other CSS properties (like <code>text-align</code>, <c=
ode>padding</code>) must still be applied to <code>&lt;td&gt;</code> / <cod=
e>&lt;th&gt;</code> directly.</p>
</blockquote>
