<p dir=3D"auto">The <code>&lt;ol&gt;</code> element supports several attrib=
utes to control numbering style and starting value:</p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Attribute</th>
<th>Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>type</code></td>
<td>Sets the numbering style</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>start</code></td>
<td>Sets the starting number (integer)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>reversed</code></td>
<td>Counts down instead of up</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong><code>type</code> values:</strong></p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Value</th>
<th>Output</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>1</code></td>
<td>1, 2, 3 =E2=80=A6 (default)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>a</code></td>
<td>a, b, c =E2=80=A6</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>A</code></td>
<td>A, B, C =E2=80=A6</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>i</code></td>
<td>i, ii, iii =E2=80=A6</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>I</code></td>
<td>I, II, III =E2=80=A6</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
