<p dir=3D"auto">A <strong>description list</strong> (<code>&lt;dl&gt;</code=
>) is used to present a list of term=E2=80=93description pairs. It is ideal=
 for glossaries, metadata, FAQs, and key-value data.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Elements:</strong></p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Element</th>
<th>Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>&lt;dl&gt;</code></td>
<td>Container for the description list</td>
</tr>
<tr>
