<p dir=3D"auto">The <code>&lt;iframe&gt;</code> HTML element represents a n=
ested browsing context, embedding another HTML page into the current one. E=
ach embedded browsing context has its own <strong>session history</strong> =
and <strong>document</strong>. The browsing context that embeds the others =
is called the parent browsing context. The topmost browsing context =E2=80=
=94 the one with no parent =E2=80=94 is usually the browser window, represe=
nted by the <strong>Window</strong> object.</p>
