<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Security rules:</strong></p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Rule</th>
<th>Why</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Always validate <code>event.origin</code></td>
<td>Prevents messages from malicious pages</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Never use <code>targetOrigin: "*"</code> for sensitive data</td>
<td>Any page could intercept it</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Validate the message shape/type</td>
<td>Prevents processing malformed payloads</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Do not use <code>innerHTML</code> with received data</td>
<td>XSS risk</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
