<p dir=3D"auto">The <code>target</code> attribute on <code>&lt;a&gt;</code>=
, <code>&lt;form&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;area&gt;</code>, and <code>&lt;base&=
gt;</code> specifies <strong>where</strong> to open the linked resource.</p=
>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Value</th>
<th>Behavior</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>_self</code></td>
<td>Opens in the <strong>same</strong> browsing context (default)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>_blank</code></td>
<td>Opens in a <strong>new</strong> tab or window</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>_parent</code></td>
<td>Opens in the <strong>parent</strong> browsing context (relevant for ifr=
ames)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>_top</code></td>
