<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>1. rel=3D"nofollow"</strong></p>
<p dir=3D"auto">When <code>rel=3D"nofollow"</code> tag is used, it instruct=
 the search engines not to pass any PageRank from one page to the other. It=
 does not allow it to pass the authority to the specific website. The main =
advantage of using this attribute is to control the spam attack.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto">There may be times, when you do not have control over what =
people publish on your websites, for example some blog comments and some ki=
nd of forum posting.</p>
