<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>2. Canvas:</strong></p>
<p dir=3D"auto">Canvas is a HTML element is used to draw graphics on a web =
page. It is a  bitmap with an =E2=80=9Cimmediate mode=E2=80=9D graphics app=
lication programming interface (API) for drawing on it. The <code>&lt;canva=
s&gt;</code> element is only a container for graphics. In order to draw the=
 graphics, you are supposed to use a script. Canvas has several strategies =
when it comes to drawing paths, boxes, circles, text &amp; adding images.</=
p>
