<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Decision guide:</strong></p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Need</th>
<th>Best method</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Style with CSS (colors, hover)</td>
<td>Inline SVG</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Icon in content (accessible alt text)</td>
<td><code>&lt;img&gt;</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Decorative background</td>
<td>CSS <code>background-image</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Interactive / animated SVG</td>
<td>Inline SVG</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Cacheable, unmodified asset</td>
<td><code>&lt;img&gt;</code> or CSS</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
