l-kos">(</span><span class=3D"pl-s">'key'</span><span class=3D"pl-kos">)</s=
pan><span class=3D"pl-kos">;</span>

<span class=3D"pl-c">// Remove saved data from sessionStorage</span>
<span class=3D"pl-s1">sessionStorage</span><span class=3D"pl-kos">.</span><=
