<p dir=3D"auto">A cookie is an amount of information that persists between =
a server-side and a client-side. A web browser stores this information at t=
he time of browsing.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto">A cookie contains the information as a string generally in =
the form of a name-value pair separated by semi-colons. It maintains the st=
ate of a user and remembers the user's information among all the web pages.=
</p>
