=3D"pl-s">"username=3DAnjali Batta"</span><span class=3D"pl-kos">;</span>

<span class=3D"pl-c">// cookie with expiry date</span>
<span class=3D"pl-smi">document</span><span class=3D"pl-kos">.</span><span =
class=3D"pl-c1">cookie</span> <span class=3D"pl-c1">=3D</span> <span class=
=3D"pl-s">"username=3DAnjali Batta; expires=3DThu, 18 Dec 2022 12:00:00 UTC=
"</span><span class=3D"pl-kos">;</span></pre><div class=3D"zeroclipboard-co=
ntainer">
