<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>When to use MutationObserver:</strong></p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li><strong>Third-party DOM changes</strong> =E2=80=94 React when a library=
 or extension modifies the DOM</li>
<li><strong>Custom element lifecycle</strong> =E2=80=94 Detect when a compo=
nent is added/removed</li>
<li><strong>Lazy-init widgets</strong> =E2=80=94 Initialize a plugin when a=
 container appears in DOM</li>
<li><strong>Polling replacement</strong> =E2=80=94 Avoid <code>setInterval<=
/code> DOM checks</li>
</ul>
