<p dir=3D"auto">A <strong>Web Worker</strong> is a JavaScript script that r=
uns in a <strong>background thread</strong>, separate from the main browser=
 thread. It allows long-running or CPU-intensive tasks to execute without b=
locking the UI =E2=80=94 keeping the page responsive.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>The problem Web Workers solve:</strong></p>
<p dir=3D"auto">JavaScript is single-threaded. Any heavy computation runs o=
n the main thread, which also handles rendering and user interactions. Long=
 tasks freeze the UI:</p>
