<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>What Web Workers can and cannot do:</strong></p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Can do</th>
<th>Cannot do</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Perform heavy computations</td>
<td>Access the DOM</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Make <code>fetch</code> / <code>XMLHttpRequest</code> calls</td>
<td>Access <code>window</code>, <code>document</code>, <code>parent</code><=
/td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Use <code>setTimeout</code> / <code>setInterval</code></td>
<td>Manipulate UI elements directly</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Use <code>IndexedDB</code></td>
<td>Use <code>localStorage</code> (synchronous)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Import scripts via <code>importScripts()</code></td>
<td>Use <code>alert()</code> / <code>confirm()</code></td>
</tr>
