<p dir=3D"auto">Both run in background threads but serve fundamentally diff=
erent purposes:</p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th></th>
<th>Web Worker</th>
<th>Service Worker</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><strong>Primary purpose</strong></td>
<td>Offload CPU-intensive computation from the main thread</td>
<td>Act as a network proxy for caching, offline support, and push notificat=
ions</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Scope</strong></td>
<td>Tied to a single page</td>
<td>Registered for an entire origin (<code>/</code>)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Lifecycle</strong></td>
<td>Lives as long as the page is open</td>
<td>Persists independently; can run after page is closed</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>DOM access</strong></td>
<td>No</td>
<td>No</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Network interception</strong></td>
<td>No</td>
<td>Yes =E2=80=94 intercepts <code>fetch</code> requests</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Cache API access</strong></td>
<td>Limited</td>
<td>Yes =E2=80=94 primary use case</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Push notifications</strong></td>
<td>No</td>
<td>Yes</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Created with</strong></td>
<td><code>new Worker()</code></td>
<td><code>navigator.serviceWorker.register()</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Communication</strong></td>
<td><code>postMessage</code> directly</td>
<td><code>postMessage</code> via <code>navigator.serviceWorker</code></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
