<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>When to use which:</strong></p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li>Use a <strong>Web Worker</strong> when you need to run JavaScript compu=
tation without freezing the UI (parsing, encryption, image processing).</li=
>
<li>Use a <strong>Service Worker</strong> when you need offline support, ba=
ckground sync, or push notifications.</li>
</ul>
