<p dir=3D"auto">Screen readers are software programs that  provide assistiv=
e technologies that allow people with disabilities (such as no sight, sound=
 or mouse-ing ability) to use web applications. You can make your sites mor=
e accessible by following ARIA standards such as semantic HTML, alt attribu=
tes and using [role=3Dbutton] in the expected ways</p>
