<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Skip navigation links</strong> (or "skip links") ar=
e hidden anchor links placed at the very top of a page that allow keyboard =
and screen reader users to jump past repetitive navigation blocks directly =
to the main content.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto">Without a skip link, keyboard users must Tab through every =
navigation item on every page load before reaching the content =E2=80=94 a =
significant accessibility barrier.</p>
