<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>ARIA live regions</strong> announce dynamic content=
 changes to screen reader users without requiring them to navigate to the c=
hanged area. This is critical for alerts, notifications, status messages, a=
nd any content that updates without a page reload.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong><code>aria-live</code> values:</strong></p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Value</th>
<th>Behavior</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>off</code></td>
<td>No announcements (default)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>polite</code></td>
<td>Announces after the user finishes current activity =E2=80=94 does <stro=
ng>not</strong> interrupt</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>assertive</code></td>
<td>Interrupts the user immediately =E2=80=94 use sparingly</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
