<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Common roles that imply live regions:</strong></p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Role</th>
<th>Equivalent live behavior</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>role=3D"alert"</code></td>
<td><code>aria-live=3D"assertive"</code>, <code>aria-atomic=3D"true"</code>=
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>role=3D"status"</code></td>
<td><code>aria-live=3D"polite"</code>, <code>aria-atomic=3D"true"</code></t=
d>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>role=3D"log"</code></td>
<td><code>aria-live=3D"polite"</code>, <code>aria-relevant=3D"additions"</c=
ode></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>role=3D"timer"</code></td>
<td><code>aria-live=3D"off"</code> (announcements on demand)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>role=3D"marquee"</code></td>
<td><code>aria-live=3D"off"</code></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Best practices:</strong></p>
<ol dir=3D"auto">
<li>Inject the live region into the DOM on page load (empty) =E2=80=94 don'=
t inject it dynamically when you need to announce.</li>
<li>Use <code>polite</code> by default; only use <code>assertive</code> for=
 error messages and time-sensitive alerts.</li>
<li>Announce meaningful, concise messages =E2=80=94 screen readers read exa=
ctly what's in the region.</li>
