<p dir=3D"auto">In traditional multi-page apps, the browser automatically m=
oves focus to the top of the page on navigation. SPAs update content withou=
t a page load, so focus management becomes the developer's responsibility =
=E2=80=94 without it, keyboard and screen reader users get lost.</p>
