<td>Compress, correct size, sprites</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Scripts</td>
<td><code>defer</code>/<code>async</code>, external files, bottom of body</=
td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Requests</td>
<td>Combine files, remove 404s, reduce cookies</td>
</tr>
