<p dir=3D"auto"><code>data-*</code> attributes let you store custom data di=
rectly on HTML elements without using non-standard attributes or extra DOM =
properties.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>When to use them:</strong></p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li>When you need to store extra information on an element that has no appr=
opriate HTML attribute</li>
<li>To pass data from server-rendered HTML to JavaScript without extra API =
calls</li>
<li>To drive behavior in JavaScript/CSS without polluting class names</li>
</ul>
