<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>WebSQL</strong> is a deprecated browser API that pr=
ovided a relational database using a variant of <strong>SQLite</strong> dir=
ectly in the browser. It allowed web pages to use SQL queries (<code>SELECT=
</code>, <code>INSERT</code>, <code>UPDATE</code>, <code>DELETE</code>) on =
a local client-side database.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Status: Deprecated and removed</strong><br>
WebSQL was never standardized by the W3C. It was rejected in favor of Index=
edDB and was <strong>removed from Chrome in 2024</strong> and has not been =
supported in Firefox or Edge for many years.</p>
