<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Why WebSQL was deprecated:</strong></p>
<ol dir=3D"auto">
<li>It was based on SQLite, which tied the spec to a specific SQL dialect</=
li>
<li>No browser other than WebKit-based browsers implemented it</li>
<li>The W3C stopped working on it in 2010</li>
<li>IndexedDB was chosen as the standard replacement</li>
</ol>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Migration path:</strong> Use <strong>IndexedDB</str=
ong> (with a library like <a href=3D"https://dexie.org/" rel=3D"nofollow">D=
exie.js</a> or <a href=3D"https://github.com/jakearchibald/idb">idb</a> for=
 a friendlier API) instead of WebSQL.</p>
