<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Atomic Design</strong> is a methodology for creatin=
g design systems by composing UI components in a hierarchy inspired by chem=
istry. It was introduced by Brad Frost.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto">The five levels are:</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>1. Atoms</strong><br>
The smallest, indivisible UI building blocks =E2=80=94 single HTML elements=
 that cannot be broken down further without losing their functionality.</p>
