<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Indexing</strong></p>
<p dir=3D"auto">Indexing is the process of analyzing and storing crawled co=
ntent in the search engine's database (index) so it can be retrieved in res=
ponse to a search query.</p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li>After crawling, Google processes the page's content, HTML, images, meta=
data</li>
<li>If the page is deemed indexable, it enters the index</li>
<li>The <code>&lt;meta name=3D"robots" content=3D"noindex"&gt;</code> tag p=
revents a page from being indexed</li>
</ul>
