<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Resource hints</strong> are HTML link directives th=
at tell the browser to perform certain network operations early =E2=80=94 b=
efore they are needed =E2=80=94 to speed up page load. They are set in the =
<code>&lt;head&gt;</code> using <code>&lt;link&gt;</code> tags.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>1. <code>dns-prefetch</code> =E2=80=94 Resolve DNS =
early</strong></p>
<p dir=3D"auto">Resolves the DNS lookup for a domain before any resource fr=
om it is requested. Cheap and broadly supported.</p>
