<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Common CSP directives:</strong></p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Directive</th>
<th>Controls</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>default-src</code></td>
<td>Fallback for all resource types</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>script-src</code></td>
<td>JavaScript sources</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>style-src</code></td>
<td>CSS sources</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>img-src</code></td>
<td>Image sources</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>font-src</code></td>
<td>Font sources</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>connect-src</code></td>
<td>AJAX, WebSocket, fetch targets</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>frame-src</code></td>
<td><code>&lt;iframe&gt;</code> sources</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>media-src</code></td>
<td><code>&lt;audio&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;video&gt;</code> sources</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>form-action</code></td>
<td><code>&lt;form action&gt;</code> targets</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>upgrade-insecure-requests</code></td>
<td>Upgrade HTTP to HTTPS</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Common source values:</strong></p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Value</th>
<th>Meaning</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>'self'</code></td>
<td>Same origin only</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>'none'</code></td>
<td>No sources allowed</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>'unsafe-inline'</code></td>
<td>Allow inline <code>&lt;script&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;style&gt;</code>=
 (avoid when possible)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>'unsafe-eval'</code></td>
<td>Allow <code>eval()</code> (avoid when possible)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>'nonce-xxxxx'</code></td>
<td>Allow specific inline script with matching nonce</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>https:</code></td>
<td>Any HTTPS source</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>https://cdn.example.com</code></td>
<td>Specific origin</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Nonce-based approach (preferred over <code>unsafe-i=
nline</code>):</strong></p>
<div class=3D"highlight highlight-text-html-basic notranslate position-rela=
