<td>Bold text =E2=80=94 no semantic weight</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>&lt;strong&gt;</code></td>
<td>Semantic</td>
<td><strong>Important</strong> content; screen readers may stress it</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>&lt;i&gt;</code></td>
<td>Presentational</td>
<td>Italic text =E2=80=94 no semantic meaning</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>&lt;em&gt;</code></td>
<td>Semantic</td>
<td><strong>Emphasized</strong> content; screen readers change tone</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
