<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Caveats:</strong></p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li>Affects <strong>all</strong> relative URLs on the page including <code>=
&lt;link&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;script&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;img&gt;</code>,=
 and <code>&lt;a&gt;</code> tags</li>
<li>Fragment identifiers (<code>#section</code>) are also resolved relative=
 to the base URL, which can break in-page anchor links</li>
<li>Single-Page Applications (SPAs) using the History API often set <code>&=
lt;base href=3D"/"&gt;</code> to ensure correct asset resolution after deep=
-link navigations</li>
</ul>
