<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Why it matters over <code>div</code>-based modals:<=
/strong></p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li>Native focus trapping (keyboard users can't escape to background)</li>
<li>Backdrop via <code>::backdrop</code> pseudo-element</li>
<li>Escape key closes it automatically</li>
<li>Proper ARIA semantics out of the box</li>
</ul>
