<p dir=3D"auto">Both attributes link to external resources, but they are us=
ed differently:</p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th></th>
<th><code>src</code></th>
<th><code>href</code></th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Full form</td>
<td>Source</td>
<td>Hypertext Reference</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Purpose</td>
<td><strong>Embeds</strong> the resource into the current document</td>
<td><strong>Links</strong> to the resource (creates a relationship)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Blocks rendering?</td>
<td>Yes =E2=80=94 browser pauses parsing to fetch and execute</td>
<td>No =E2=80=94 fetched in parallel</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Used on</td>
<td><code>&lt;img&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;script&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;iframe=
&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;video&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;audio&gt;</code></td>
<td><code>&lt;a&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;link&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;base&gt;</=
code></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
