<p dir=3D"auto">The <code>contenteditable</code> attribute makes any HTML e=
lement directly editable by the user in the browser, similar to a text fiel=
d but with rich-text capabilities.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Values:</strong></p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
