<th>Behavior</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>true</code> or empty string</td>
<td>Element is editable</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>false</code></td>
<td>Element is not editable (overrides inherited editability)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>plaintext-only</code></td>
<td>Editable but pasting formatted content is stripped to plain text</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
