<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Key characteristics:</strong></p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li>Supports copy/paste, undo/redo, and spell-checking natively</li>
<li>Used as the foundation for rich text editors (e.g., Medium, Notion, Qui=
ll.js, Slate.js)</li>
<li>Content can be retrieved via <code>innerHTML</code> or <code>innerText<=
/code></li>
<li>Does <strong>not</strong> submit with <code>&lt;form&gt;</code> =E2=80=
=94 use a hidden <code>&lt;input&gt;</code> to capture the value on submit<=
/li>
<li>Always sanitize <code>innerHTML</code> output before persisting to avoi=
d XSS</li>
</ul>
