<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Why Shadow DOM matters:</strong></p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li>Scoped CSS =E2=80=94 no class name collisions between components</li>
<li>Encapsulated DOM =E2=80=94 child nodes hidden from <code>querySelector<=
/code> on the main document</li>
<li>Foundation for Web Components and frameworks like Lit, Stencil, and nat=
ive browser UI elements (<code>&lt;input&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;video&gt;</c=
ode>)</li>
</ul>
