<p dir=3D"auto">The <code>&lt;template&gt;</code> element holds <strong>ine=
rt HTML markup</strong> that is not rendered or executed when the page load=
s. Its content is only activated (cloned and inserted) via JavaScript. It i=
s a key part of the Web Components standard.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Key properties:</strong></p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li>Content inside <code>&lt;template&gt;</code> is <strong>parsed</strong>=
 but not rendered</li>
<li>Scripts inside do not execute, images do not load, styles have no effec=
t</li>
<li>Accessible via <code>template.content</code> which returns a <code>Docu=
mentFragment</code></li>
</ul>
