<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Advantages over <code>innerHTML</code>:</strong></p=
>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li>Parsed once by the browser (efficient)</li>
<li>No XSS risk from template structure itself</li>
<li>Works with <code>DocumentFragment</code>, which is faster to manipulate=
 than live DOM</li>
</ul>
