<p dir=3D"auto">Or use <a href=3D"https://www.srihash.org/" rel=3D"nofollow=
">srihash.org</a> to generate hashes online.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Why <code>crossorigin=3D"anonymous"</code> is requi=
red:</strong> SRI requires the resource to be served with CORS headers. The=
 <code>crossorigin=3D"anonymous"</code> attribute tells the browser to make=
 a CORS request without sending credentials.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Why it matters for security:</strong></p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li>Prevents <strong>CDN compromise attacks</strong> =E2=80=94 if an attack=
er modifies a CDN-hosted file, browsers will refuse to load it</li>
<li>Mitigates supply-chain attacks for third-party scripts</li>
<li>Recommended by OWASP as a best practice for third-party resource inclus=
ion</li>
</ul>
