<div class=3D"markdown-heading" dir=3D"auto"><h2 tabindex=3D"-1" class=3D"h=
eading-element" dir=3D"auto">Q. What is the <code>sandbox</code> attribute =
on <code>&lt;iframe&gt;</code> and how does it enhance security?</h2><a id=
=3D"user-content-q-what-is-the-sandbox-attribute-on-iframe-and-how-does-it-=
enhance-security" class=3D"anchor" aria-label=3D"Permalink: Q. What is the =
sandbox attribute on &lt;iframe&gt; and how does it enhance security?" href=
=3D"https://github.com/learning-zone/html-basics#q-what-is-the-sandbox-attr=
ibute-on-iframe-and-how-does-it-enhance-security"><svg data-component=3D"Oc=
ticon" class=3D"octicon octicon-link" viewBox=3D"0 0 16 16" version=3D"1.1"=
