<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Clickjacking</strong> is a UI redressing attack whe=
re a malicious page embeds your website inside a transparent or hidden <cod=
e>&lt;iframe&gt;</code> and tricks users into clicking on elements of your =
site while thinking they are clicking on the attacker's page.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Example scenario:</strong></p>
<ol dir=3D"auto">
<li>Attacker creates a page with an attractive button: "Click to win a priz=
e!"</li>
<li>Your bank's "Transfer Funds" button is overlaid invisibly via a transpa=
rent iframe</li>
<li>User clicks the "prize" button, unknowingly triggering the fund transfe=
r</li>
</ol>
